        <item>
            <title>0.8.14</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 22:38:03 +1200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>25</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.14</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}.rn{font:13px/1.5 -apple-system,"SF Pro Text",sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:4px 2px}.rn h1{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 10px}.rn h2{font-size:14px;margin:14px 0 6px}.rn ul{margin:6px 0;padding-left:20px}.rn li{margin-bottom:7px}.rn code{font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.rn{color:#e8e8ed}}</style><div class="rn"><h1>Rein 0.8.14</h1>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed the 0.8.13 crash.</b> Rein could quit itself minutes after launch (typically right after a display change or wake) when the menu bar tidy checked its divider while the divider's window was momentarily off-screen. If Rein kept disappearing on you and your hidden icons came back, this was why — update and it stays running.</li>
</ul></div>
]]></description>
